    "created_at": "2017-04-04T12:22:32Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-04T12:22:32Z",
    "body": "Can we drop Appcache, though? Are many sites using it? And are there\nusecases for it that SW doesn't easily meet? Eg, making mostly-textual\nsites work offline?\n\n-- \nBruce Lawson\nwww.brucelawson.co.uk\nwww.twitter.com/brucel\n",
