    "created_at": "2017-04-07T16:25:46Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-04-07T16:25:46Z",
    "body": "I think we should aim to. Appcache represents a huge security hole on HTTP, and isn't doing what most authors expect. It's near impossible to make a mostly-textual site work offline with appcache.\r\n\r\nI'm not against a high-level API for common cases, but a library should guide the way.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
    "pin": null,
