    "updated_at": "2019-10-25T07:07:49Z",
    "body": "Yes, I expect we're able to remove it from the specification somewhere in the first half of 2020, after Chrome and Firefox unship it successfully. (Thanks to @jonathanKingston for starting that whole initiative up again recently!)",
