    "updated_at": "2019-10-27T10:51:53Z",
    "body": "I went searching more carefully for bugs tracking removing it:\r\n\r\n- Chromium: https://bugs.chromium.org/p/chromium/issues/detail?id=582750 looks to be it, but no relevant activity for a year and a half.\r\n- Firefox: https://bugzilla.mozilla.org/show_bug.cgi?id=1584984 being by Jonathan Kingston within the last month matches what you describe.\r\n- WebKit: can’t find anything, but not sure whether I’d *expect* to find anything.\r\n\r\nNot being inside the community, this information may very well be incomplete or incorrect.",
    "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
