    "updated_at": "2020-04-17T10:00:53Z",
    "body": "At the moment it looks like the beginning of June will see AppCache removed in Firefox 77 and the AppCache API will continue to exist but no-op.\r\n\r\nDoes Chrome have an updated plan?",
