    "updated_at": "2020-04-17T14:29:09Z",
    "body": "Here’s the latest in Chromium: https://groups.google.com/a/chromium.org/d/msgid/blink-api-owners-discuss/CA%2B1_fV8fagVuFk%2B_Pb-TGzWyQAVj6A3vwcgjvG6GgLFm6DqTMQ%40mail.gmail.com\r\n\r\nIn essence: reverse origin trial ASAP, and target removal of AppCache for websites without origin trial for M85 (which goes stable in August).\r\n",
