    "created_at": "2020-08-06T18:44:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-08-06T18:44:59Z",
    "body": "We're about one release away from AppCache being removed in both Firefox and Chrome. It might be time to rip it out from the spec.\r\n\r\nAnyway, I stopped by to note that the \"ready for post-load tasks\" flag is almost entirely used by AppCache. print() is another consumer, but probably that could use \"completely loaded\" instead. We should probably investigate something analogous to #5796 once AppCache is gone.",
